    "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Support</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" />\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\" />\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            color: #2c3e50;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            color: #34495e;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n        .github-link {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #3498db;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 12px 24px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .github-link:hover {\n            background-color: #2980b9;\n        }\n        ul {\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        li {\n            margin: 8px 0;\n        }\n        .info-box {\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\n            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Support</h1>\n\n    <h2>Need Help?</h2>\n    <p>RemoteWeather is an open-source project hosted on GitHub. For support, feature requests, or to report issues, please visit our GitHub project:</p>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chrissnell/remoteweather\" class=\"github-link\" target=\"_blank\">Visit GitHub Project</a>\n\n    <div class=\"info-box\">\n        <strong>Having problems?</strong> We encourage you to open an issue on GitHub. This helps us track problems, provide solutions, and improve the project for everyone.\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>How to Get Support</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Check existing issues:</strong> Your question might already be answered in the <a href=\"https://github.com/chrissnell/remoteweather/issues\" target=\"_blank\">Issues</a> section</li>\n        <li><strong>Report bugs:</strong> Found a problem? <a href=\"https://github.com/chrissnell/remoteweather/issues/new\" target=\"_blank\">Open a new issue</a> with details about what you're experiencing</li>\n        <li><strong>Request features:</strong> Have an idea for improvement? Let us know by creating a feature request issue</li>\n        <li><strong>Contribute:</strong> RemoteWeather is open source! Pull requests are welcome</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Before Opening an Issue</h2>\n    <p>To help us help you quickly, please include:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>A clear description of the problem or request</li>\n        <li>Steps to reproduce the issue (if applicable)</li>\n        <li>Your RemoteWeather version and deployment environment</li>\n        <li>Relevant log output or error messages</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Community</h2>\n    <p>RemoteWeather is maintained by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrissnell\" target=\"_blank\">@chrissnell</a> and contributors. We appreciate your feedback and contributions to make this project better!</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
